{
  "slug": "dx-aem",
  "name": "Dx Aem",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "AEM component verification, dialog inspection, demo capture, QA automation, and multi-platform project knowledge for Adobe Experience Manager projects",
  "longDescription": "Ships **12 skills**, **6 agents**, **1 hook** and **2 MCP servers**.\n\n- **Skills** (12): `aem-component` (Find all source files, AEM pages, and dialog fields for an AEM component), `aem-doc-gen` (Generate AEM demo documentation — find or create docs page with configured component, capture dialog and website screenshots…), `aem-doctor` (Check health of AEM project infrastructure — verifies component definitions, OSGi configs, dispatcher rules, and content structure against…), `aem-editorial-guide` (Capture editorial guide for a component dialog in AEM — open editor, screenshot dialog, and write editor-friendly authoring…), `aem-fe-verify` (Visually verify a component's frontend rendering on local AEM — screenshots the component in wcmmode=disabled, compares against Figma…), `aem-init` (Configure AEM-specific settings for the dx workflow), `aem-page-search` (Find AEM pages that use a specific component), `aem-qa` (Verify a story's implementation on AEM as the QA Agent — navigate pages, check component rendering and dialogs,…), and 4 more\n- **Agents** (6): `aem-bug-executor` (Executes AEM-specific bug verification steps — navigates to AEM pages, reproduces bugs visually via Playwright, captures screenshots, and…), `aem-editorial-guide-capture` (Captures AEM component editorial guide via Playwright — opens editor, triggers dialog, screenshots, and writes editor-friendly docs), `aem-fe-verifier` (Verifies AEM component frontend rendering — creates/reuses demo pages, screenshots components in wcmmode=disabled via Playwright, compares against Figma…), `aem-file-resolver` (Resolves all source files for a component across project repos), `aem-inspector` (Inspects AEM components via MCP — captures dialog fields, finds pages, creates test pages, configures demo data), `aem-page-finder` (Finds all AEM pages that use a given component)\n- **Hooks** (1): `PostToolUse`\n- **MCP servers** (2): `AEM`, `playwright`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install dx-aem@claude-community` from `easingthemes/dx-aem-flow` (`plugins/dx-aem`).",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 12,
    "agent": 6,
    "hook": 1,
    "mcp": 2
  },
